+# CHANGELOG — patch v0.1.2
+
+- Clarified scientific split: 3.1 matrix = parameter-effect discovery; catalog = later propagation.
+- Corrected target-runtime bead command to `refine nbeads N`.
+- Removed `alex -1` from matrix checkpoints because target runtime lacks KP-alex.exe.
+- Added strict static/log/output audit; KnotPlot exit code 0 is no longer sufficient for PASS.
+- Existing outputs are archived before a fresh discovery campaign.
+- Added machine-readable `matrix_design.json`.
+- Added geometry-effect analysis and duplicate-geometry flags.
+- Added explicit, initially unapproved `catalog_recipe.json`.
+- Catalog conversion now injects recipe commands and embeds recipe SHA-256.
+- Added recipe selection helper and strict catalog batch runner.
+- Catalog is no longer implied by `run_all.cmd`; it requires explicit preparation/approval.
--- a/LEGACY_OUTPUTS_INVALID.md
+++ b/LEGACY_OUTPUTS_INVALID.md
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Legacy output status
+
+The `out/` and `logs/` bundled before patch v0.1.2 came from a run whose logs contain ignored/unknown relaxation commands. They are retained only for forensic comparison. Use `run_fresh_discovery.cmd` before scientific interpretation.
--- a/MATRIX.txt
+++ b/MATRIX.txt
@@ -1,3 +1,7 @@
+SCIENTIFIC ROLE
+===============
+This matrix is a DISCOVERY experiment on trefoil 3.1. It learns how KnotPlot preparation variables alter candidate geometry. It does not itself select the physical SST-stable state. After downstream stability analysis, an approved catalog_recipe.json is propagated across the catalog.
+
 KnotPlot 3.1 relaxation matrix summary
 ======================================
 
--- a/PATCH_NOTES_v0.1.2.txt
+++ b/PATCH_NOTES_v0.1.2.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+KnotPlot 3.1 Multi-Dynamics Relaxation Matrix patch v0.1.2
+================================================================
+
+Purpose restored/clarified:
+  Phase A = discover preparation-variable effects on 3.1.
+  Phase B = select/approve a recipe using matrix + downstream evidence.
+  Phase C = regenerate and run the full knot/link/torus catalog with that recipe.
+
+Key fixes:
+- target runtime: refine nbeads N instead of obsolete nbeads N;
+- charge/hooke/power/timeincr remain command syntax without '=';
+- removed alex -1 from matrix checkpoints because KP-alex.exe is absent;
+- strict runner now fails on unknown/obsolete/missing-helper log markers;
+- strict runner archives prior expected outputs and verifies every new save/coords output;
+- matrix_design.json + automated geometric effect report;
+- explicit catalog_recipe.json, unapproved by default;
+- recipe SHA locking for generated catalog scripts;
+- individual-process strict catalog batch runner.
+
+The bundled pre-patch out/logs are forensic only and must not be used as a valid discovery campaign.
